# EAS reads THIS file (repo root). Proved 10 Oct 2026: build 39 failed with
# "Unable to resolve module ../assets/sounds/coin-clink.mp3" because a blanket
# *.mp3 here stripped the app's sound effects, even though apps/mobile/.easignore
# had no such line. Keep apps/mobile/.easignore identical to avoid confusion.

# Build junk
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.expo/
**/.expo/
ios/
android/
*.log
apps/mobile/package-lock.json

# Monorepo siblings the iOS app does not import
.local/
attached_assets*/
canvas/
client/
server/
scripts/
docs/
dist/

# Large media and archives. No blanket *.mp3: the audio folders are excluded by
# name above, and apps/mobile/assets/sounds/*.mp3 must ship in the bundle.
*.tar.gz
conjugately-feature-graphic*.png
all-english-templates.txt
